\label{lemma-H0-L-morphism-ringed-spaces}
Let $f : (X, \mathcal{O}_X) \to (S, \mathcal{O}_S)$ be a morphism of
ringed spaces. Then $H^0(L_{X/S}) = \Omega_{X/S}$.
